/target/
/target-*/
fleet-data/
*.tmp
deploy/.env
HANDOFF.md

# The web UI's build output and dependencies. `apps/web/dist` is embedded into the binary at
# compile time (crates/orchestrator/build.rs leaves a placeholder when it is missing), so it is
# built, never committed.
node_modules/
apps/web/dist/
*.tsbuildinfo

# Scratch state from editor tooling that runs inside the repo. It is per-machine and per-session;
# a copy of it was staged by accident once, which is what this line is for.
.omc/

# A local code index (12 MB, rebuilt with `codegraph init`). Derived from the source, so it is
# per-machine and goes stale the moment anyone commits.
.codegraph/

# The affectUI access key, for the image build (deploy/README.md §8). This repository is public.
deploy/affectui.token
*.token
